# Return to the Depths (battlefield.return_to_the_depths, Mine Shaft #2716): the registrant's requirements
# (Quest[1][78]Prog 9). Each char triggers _0d0 and gets the messages 7097 and 32767 and a release, no menu: main
# (accepted, Prog 7: the quest's own _0d0 event answers only Prog 8); bob (accepted, Prog 10); cat (quest available,
# Prog 9); dan (quest completed, Prog 9).
lists MineShaft2716/_0d0/onTrigger
char zone=MineShaft2716 pos=-93.657,-120,-583.561 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=MineShaft2716 pos=-93.657,-120,-583.561 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=MineShaft2716 pos=-93.657,-120,-583.561 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=MineShaft2716 pos=-93.657,-120,-583.561 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Bastok.ReturnToTheDepths accepted
charvar Quest[1][78]Prog 7
bob: quest Bastok.ReturnToTheDepths accepted
bob: charvar Quest[1][78]Prog 10
cat: charvar Quest[1][78]Prog 9
dan: quest Bastok.ReturnToTheDepths completed
dan: charvar Quest[1][78]Prog 9
login
bob: login
cat: login
dan: login
trigger _0d0
bob: trigger _0d0
cat: trigger _0d0
dan: trigger _0d0
